 ReaderNavigationContext      — jumpTo: ((page: number) => void) | null, published by ReaderPager itself (registered/cleared via useEffect, not a leaf) while mounted. SurahListItem/RubList/ContinueReadingLink read it and, on a plain click, call it instead of letting their <Link> navigate — moves an already-mounted pager client-side (no network) instead of a full route change; falls back to the normal <Link> navigation whenever no pager is mounted (home page, marks, settings). See ADR 0014 Addendum 3.
